{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09648","headline":"暮秋山行 · 岑参","name":"暮秋山行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"疲马卧长坂，夕阳下通津。\n山风吹空林，飒飒如有人。\n苍旻霁凉雨，石路无飞尘。\n千念集暮节，万籁悲萧晨。\n鶗鴂昨夜鸣，蕙草色已陈。\n况在远行客，自然多苦辛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09648.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09648","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}